// E608 — no treaty between rivals.
//
// `Foireann` is in Laighin, this file is from Ciarraí, and
// Ciarraí/Baile Átha Cliath are old rivals, so no treaty can open it.
// There's no escape-hatch keyword: the way out is changing county (and
// therefore province) — try `as Luimneach` instead of `as Ciarraí` and the
// same treaty works.
//
// Adding `feidhm ainmDe(f: Foireann) -> Teaghrán { ainm ó fh }` triggers
// E609 too: the treaty isn't the only thing that fails here.

as Ciarraí

struchtúr Foireann as Baile Átha Cliath {
    ainm: Teaghrán
}

comhaontú Ciarraí Baile Átha Cliath